{"articleNo":"521569","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=521569&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] [학년별수강신청] 수강신청 가능여부 확인","writer":"교무과","writeDate":"2025.07.30","hit":"5152","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움;\">년별 수강신청기간의 수강신청 가능여부 조회 화면을 아래와 같이 안내드리오니 참고하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">▷</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청 가능여부 조회 기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:<b>&nbsp;<b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;8</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">. 4.(월</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);