255);\">&nbsp;통합정보시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">→</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">학사행정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">→</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;수업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">→</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">수강신청가능여부확인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">▷</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">참고사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 수강신청 가능여부 조회화면은 <u><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b><b>학년별</b> <b>수강신청을</b> <b>확인</b></b></span></u>하기 위함, 타학년 재수강과목 이수는 전체학년 수강신청기간을 이용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청 가능여부는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">재수강</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">이중수강</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">선수과목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">수강지도상담승인여부 등을 확인 할 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">수강꾸러미 확정 후 수강꾸러미 신청내역 반영하여 수강신청 가능여부 확인 가능</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">(<b>8.7.(목)</b>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\"><b>오후부터)</b></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-align: center;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">재수강</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">선수과목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">이중수강과목 등 수강가능 여부가 이상이 있을 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">교무과로 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">(sheiswjs@kumoh.ac.kr, 054-478-7029)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><